Implement the type inference plan in `docs/plans/type-inference.md`. The goal is to infer variable types (string, array, struct, query, numeric, boolean, xml, image, file) at parse time from RHS literals and builtin function return values. This enables filtered member function completions and validates member function calls in the unresolved scanner. Follow the execution order in the plan — each step should compile and pass tests before moving to the next.
